        "translation": "与价格监管管理者通力合作。",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "CONCEPT_DISTORTION",
        "distractorDisplayName": "偷换概念",
        "analysis": "【偷换概念】原文未涉及 price managers 这一主体。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "cooperate",
            "ipa": "[kəʊˈɒpəreɪt]",
            "meaning": "合作",
            "level": "red",
            "isSelfAnnotated": true
