        "analysis": "【正确项 · 同义替换】P5-S1 紧随破折号后的伴随定语给出了最直接的定义解释：'with accounts that vastly overstated the value of their toxic assets.'，vastly overstated（极其严重高估）精准同义改写为 exaggerated the real value。",
